- Always call `check_applicability(instrument_path, provision, as_of_date)` before stating a provision is enforceable.
- Respect EU Digital Omnibus `Regulation (EU) 2026/1744` staggered deadlines (Feb 2, 2025 Art. 5; Aug 2, 2025 GPAI; Aug 2, 2026 Art. 50; Dec 2, 2026 NCII/CSAM & legacy Art. 50(2); Dec 2, 2027 Annex III; Aug 2, 2028 Annex I).
